4. State fast-arithmetic requirements explicitly and separate the theorem from metric \(E\).
5. Replace floating-point parameter/grid calculations and Python’s long product-tree multiplication for an implementation claiming the asymptotic bound.
6. Leave priority against McKee–Pinch §5 explicitly unresolved until the chapter is inspected.
